# Text Analyzer

A modular Python text-analysis project that processes structured text data and performs a variety of analysis tasks using text preprocessing, sequence analysis, and graph-based algorithms.

The project is organized into nine independent tasks, with a central command-line interface for selecting and running each analysis.

## Features

- Text preprocessing and normalization
- Lowercase conversion
- Punctuation removal
- Redundant whitespace removal
- Tokenization and sequence analysis
- Co-occurrence detection using sliding windows
- Entity relationship analysis
- Graph traversal using Depth-First Search (DFS)
- Cycle detection
- CSV and JSON input validation
- Modular task-based architecture

